    <body id="mypage" data-spy="scroll" data-target=".navbar" data-offset="60">
        <div class="jumbotron text-center">
            <h1>Arindam Bhattacharya</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="container-fluid bg-grey" id="about">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="thumbnail">

                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <h2>About</h2>
                    I am a Ph.D. student in the Computer Science and Engineering Department at Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi. I am working in the field of Compact Data Structures, advised by Prof. Amitabha Bagchi and Prof. Srikanta Bedathur.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container-fluid bg-grey", id="publications">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <h2>Publications</h2>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
		      <li>
			<b>Adaptive Learned Bloom Filters under Incremental Workloads.</b> 2020. <i>Proceedings of the 7th ACM IKDD CoDS and 25th COMAD (CoDS COMAD 2020). Association for Computing Machinery, 107–115.</i> Arindam Bhattacharya, Srikanta Bedathur, and Amitabha Bagchi.
		      </li>
                      <li>
                        <b>Semantic textual similarity using universal networking language graph matching.</b> 2012. <i>Proceedings of the Sixth International Workshop on Semantic Evaluation (SemEval '12). Association for Computational Linguistics, 662-666.</i> Janardhan Singh, Arindam Bhattacharya, and Pushpak Bhattacharyya
                      </li>
			
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

