                    <h2>Projects</h2>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        <li><b>Recognizing Textual Entailment.</b> <i>Master's thesis with Pushpak Bhattacharyya, Indian Institute of Technology, Bombay</i>, 2012</li>
                        <li><b>Comparison and Analysis of Particle Swarm Optimization (PSO) and Multi-objective PSO algorithms.</b> <i>Bachelor's thesis with Bijan Bihari Mishra, Silicon Institute of Technology</i>, 2010</li>
                        <li><b>Crowdsourcing to collect bilingual machine translation data using Facebook's Apps API.</b> <i>Course project for CS 626-460: Natural Language Processing</i>, 2011</li>
                        <li><b>Ants: Google AI Challange.</b> <i>Top 100 (59) among 7900 participants</i>, 2011</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
