                      <li><b>Teaching Assistant -</b> <a href="http://www.cse.iitd.ac.in/~parags/teaching/2017/sp17/col774/">COL 774 - Machine Learning, Spring 2017</a>, Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi</li>
                      <li><b>Teaching Assistant -</b> <a href="http://www.cse.iitd.ac.in/~mausam/courses/col333/autumn2016/">COL 333/671 - Artificial Intelligence, Autumn 2016</a>, Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi</li>
                      <li><b>Teaching Assistant -</b> <a href="https://www.cse.iitb.ac.in/~cs621-2011/">CS 621 - Artificial Intelligence, Autumn 2011</a>, Indian Institute of Technology, Bombay</li>
